            "review_title": "Review at Catina Chicken",
            "review_text": "Ashley O.\nUnited Kingdom4 contributions\n1\nFlavourful chicken, highly would recommend\nDec 2023 • Couples\nVisiting Vietnam with my boyfriend and didn't know where to go so we were just browsing around and found this amazing diner! Absolutely loved the flavours of the fried chicken here, the sauces were very interesting. Plus, ice cold beers and super friendly staff!\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten December 6, 2023",
